{
  "bodyHash": "3K9vLFqqhyQ=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Tanuki Decor 裝飾模組</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組新增超過 200 種方塊，涵蓋時鐘、座椅、床鋪、儲物、燈具與裝飾等類別。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>自製工藝</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">透過自製工作臺來製作家具。將鵝卵石、原木、黏土球與鐵錠放入自製工作臺，選擇欲製作的物品即可。自製配方可在設定檔中停用。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/diy_workbench_gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"499\" height=\"280\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>時鐘</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擁有 30 多款時鐘，每款皆有精美紋理與獨特音效。許多時鐘會在正午、午夜或黎明時鳴響，最棒的是，它們能準確顯示遊戲時間！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/grandfather_clock.png\" width=\"61\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_clock_tower_dial.png\" width=\"93\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/owl_clock.png\" width=\"49\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/green_clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/red_clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"73\" height=\"100\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>座椅</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">享受 20 多種座椅選擇，從凳子、椅子到沙發應有盡有。終於，在辛苦挖礦與製作後回家，可以翹腳放鬆。部分座椅還能同時容納兩名玩家！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/sweets_sofa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cabana_chair.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gorgeous_seat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"88\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/wooden_block_chair.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"100\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>床鋪</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">厭倦了那些小型、霓虹色的床？不想再和村民共用床位？本模組提供 10 多款主題床鋪，包括雙人床與四柱床。當然，舒適的枕頭永遠附在其中！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/green_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/antique_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gorgeous_bed.png\" width=\"144\" height=\"160\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/wooden_block_bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"120\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>儲物</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tanuki Decor 新增 30 多種儲物方塊，從床頭櫃到 2x2 大型衣櫃應有盡有。大多數儲物方塊能存放雙倍箱子的物品量。選擇最適合的款式，告別難看的箱子和木桶吧。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/antique_cabinet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"121\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/blue_wardrobe.png\" width=\"88\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/minimalist_dresser.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cabana_vanity.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"120\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>燈具</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有了燈、壁爐甚至霓虹標誌，誰還需要火把？用十多種溫馨的照明選項來升級你的家。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/minimalist_lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"49\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_fireplace.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/egyptian_lamp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/regal_wall_lamp.png\" width=\"95\" height=\"80\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>家具系列</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用來自 10 個不同系列的精選家具展現自我。收集整套系列吧！</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">古董系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/antique_series.png\" alt=\"古董系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">藍色系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/blue_series.png\" alt=\"藍色系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">海濱小屋系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/cabana_series.png\" alt=\"海濱小屋系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">埃及系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/egyptian_series.png\" alt=\"埃及系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">華麗系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/gorgeous_series.png\" alt=\"華麗系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">綠色系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/green_series.png\" alt=\"綠色系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">實驗室系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/lab_series.png\" alt=\"實驗室系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">極簡系列</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/minimalist_series.png\" alt=\"極簡系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘑菇系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/mushroom_series.png\" alt=\"蘑菇系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">皇家系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/regal_series.png\" alt=\"皇家系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">糖果系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/sweets_series.png\" alt=\"糖果系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">木塊系列</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/screenshots/wooden_block_series.png\" alt=\"木塊系列\" width=\"680\" height=\"360\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>裝飾</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組中另有 60 多種裝飾方塊，包括各種尺寸的桌子、各式花瓶、彩色飄帶與其他點綴物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/gumball_machine.png\" width=\"55\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/ship_in_a_bottle.png\" width=\"77\" height=\"80\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/blue_table.png\" width=\"136\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/sweets_mini_table.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"109\" height=\"100\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/stall_tarp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"132\" height=\"120\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>功能性</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">部分方塊除了美觀之外，還具備額外功能！更多細節請見下方說明。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鳥籠</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有養鸚鵡嗎？想把牠關起來好好看管？鳥籠正是你需要的！當鸚鵡停在你肩膀上時，對著鳥籠按右鍵即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/birdcage.png\" alt=\"鳥籠\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/elegant_birdcage.png\" alt=\"雅緻鳥籠\" width=\"80\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">收銀機</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動即可發出令人滿足的「叮」聲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/cash_register.png\" alt=\"收銀機\" width=\"121\" height=\"133\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">展示櫃</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用優質的展示櫃來炫耀你的珍藏吧！也能顯示自訂名稱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/display_case.png\" alt=\"展示櫃\" width=\"156\" height=\"240\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/long_display_case.png\" alt=\"長形展示櫃\" width=\"176\" height=\"206\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地球儀</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動後會隨機旋轉。地球儀會根據停止轉動時面對的方向輸出比較器訊號。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/globe.png\" alt=\"地球儀\" width=\"104\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手推車</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">兼具功能與裝飾性的物品儲存方式</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/handcart.png\" alt=\"手推車\" width=\"106\" height=\"87\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">沙漏</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動後開始30秒計時，每隔2秒輸出比較器訊號變化。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/hourglass.png\" alt=\"沙漏\" width=\"113\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷你公仔</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動後會發出毛絨玩具的吱吱聲。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/mayoral_mini_figure.png\" alt=\"市長迷你公仔\" width=\"123\" height=\"126\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">節拍器</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動可調整擺動速度，也能關閉。共有7段速度設定。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/metronome.png\" alt=\"節拍器\" width=\"88\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牛頓擺</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動可開啟或關閉。在下方放置羊毛方塊可使其靜音。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/newtons_cradle.png\" alt=\"牛頓擺\" width=\"119\" height=\"120\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留聲機</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡直是唱片機2.0！坐下來看著唱片轉動，聆聽你最愛的黑膠唱片。支援漏斗與1.20+非模組唱片機相同的互動方式。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/phonograph.png\" alt=\"留聲機\" width=\"129\" height=\"179\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">鋼琴</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動後會隨機演奏一個音符。若鋼琴下方有音符盒，則改為演奏該音符盒的音色。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/piano.png\" alt=\"鋼琴\" width=\"168\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">電漿球</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟動可開啟或關閉。哇，好會扭動！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/plasma_ball.gif\" alt=\"電漿球\" width=\"195\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火箭燈</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">好吧，這個沒有特殊用途。我只是想展示它的動畫效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/rocket_lamp.gif\" alt=\"火箭燈\" width=\"195\" height=\"223\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">科學艙</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在這些充滿泡泡的科幻艙體中展示特殊物品，喚醒你內心的瘋狂科學家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/science_pod.png\" alt=\"科學艙\" width=\"90\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">吃角子老虎機</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你膽子夠大嗎？快來拉一把！吃角子老虎機運作時會輸出比較器訊號1，中獎時則輸出15。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/slot_machine.png\" alt=\"吃角子老虎機\" width=\"90\" height=\"192\"></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火車模型</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">觀賞模型火車在無盡的軌道上奔馳。可在軌道下方放置羊毛方塊以消除音效。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/train_set.png\" alt=\"火車模型\" width=\"192\" height=\"94\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\">花瓶</span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些瓷花瓶雖然只能放一組物品，但至少外觀很漂亮！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/classic_vase.png\" alt=\"經典花瓶\" width=\"76\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"華麗花瓶\" width=\"76\" height=\"120\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"大型華麗花瓶\" width=\"101\" height=\"160\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/large_striped_vase.png\" alt=\"大型條紋花瓶\" width=\"120\" height=\"140\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/small_fancy_vase.png\" alt=\"小型華麗花瓶\" width=\"53\" height=\"56\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/skyjay1/img/master/tanukidecor/blocks/small_striped_vase.png\" alt=\"小型條紋花瓶\" width=\"69\" height=\"56\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可透過將物品加入「tanukidecor:diy_blacklist」物品標籤來停用特定物品及其合成配方。<br>更多選項請參閱設定檔「tanukidecor-common.cfg」。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鳴謝</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/skyjay1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">skyjay1</a> - 程式碼與維護<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tobcs123/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thatonebrasschronoshinx</a> - 點子、專案管理及音效設計<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/skart/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skart2000</a> - 模型與美術<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crabmods/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CrabMods</a> - 移植至NeoForge 1.21.1</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>常見問題</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：支援Forge還是Fabric？<br><strong>答</strong>：僅支援Forge / NeoForge。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：我可以在模組包中使用此模組嗎？<br><strong>答</strong>：可以。請連結至<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tanukidecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge頁面</a>，請勿直接重新發佈模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：你們有Discord嗎？<br><strong>答</strong>：你可以在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.tophatcat.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">MMD伺服器</a>的<span style=\"color:#36f\">#skyjay-mods</span>頻道中找到我（位於「社群模組」分類下）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問</strong>：我有個建議！<br><strong>答</strong>：太好了！請在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tanukidecor\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge頁面</a>留言，或前往<a href=\"https://github.com/skyjay1/Tanuki-Decor/issues/2\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>的建議問題區發表。</span></p>",
